ian city it  detects a human kaiju hybrid  in the basement of the ppdc recruitment  center and tries to establish a neural  bridge with it  but fails and after meridian city falls  during operation blackout  apex roams the ruined city and australia  picking off  canine kaiju that hunts in the area  during one of its hunts  it inadvertently saves taylor and haley  the protagonist from sudden death  but tries to eat them next it later  responds to the sound of haley calling  for help  and goes after the canine kaiju that  also called  rippers and it goes after them again  later in the series in the boneyard  scenes it engages  a category 3 kaiju called acid quill and  attacks atlas destroy as well apex is  then halted by the kaiju boy  accompanying the travis siblings and it  recognizing this child  as the hybrid it attempted to drift with  before apex and the boy forms a bond  the two shared their memories in the  drift before linking with haley to  validate the boy's story  which convinces apex to cease all  hostile actions against atlas destroyer  as a parting token it gives the travel  siblings  the arm of chaos nemesis before moving  on to consume the corpse of acid quill  this shows that the creature is sentient  and only attacks for survival  it initially did not want to attack  atlas destroyer but was forced into the  fight  because the two protagonists thought it  was gonna kill the boy and so with that  we come to the end of this video  do like for support subscribe to be a  part of this mind cue family  and also smash that notification bell  for regular updates when we post new  videos  on monsters specific rim kaiju's  creatures  godzilla vs condescension videos and  more right here on minecube  take care fam

